#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:1
msgid "Class: Pool"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:3
msgid "Extends: `undici.Dispatcher`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:5
msgid ""
"A pool of [Client](/docs/docs/api/Client.md) instances connected to the "
"same upstream target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:7
msgid "Requests are not guaranteed to be dispatched in order of invocation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:9
msgid "`new Pool(url[, options])`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:11
msgid "Arguments:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:13
msgid ""
"**url** `URL | string` - It should only include the **protocol, hostname,"
" and port**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:14
msgid "**options** `PoolOptions` (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:16
msgid "Parameter: `PoolOptions`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:18
msgid ""
"Extends: [`ClientOptions`](/docs/docs/api/Client.md#parameter-"
"clientoptions)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:20
msgid ""
"**factory** `(origin: URL, opts: Object) => Dispatcher` - Default: "
"`(origin, opts) => new Client(origin, opts)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:21
msgid ""
"**connections** `number | null` (optional) - Default: `null` - The number"
" of `Client` instances to create. When set to `null`, the `Pool` instance"
" will create an unlimited amount of `Client` instances."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Pool.md:22
msgid ""
"**clientTtl** `number | null` (optional) - Default: `null` - The amount "
"of time before a `Client` instance is removed from the `Pool` and closed."
"   When set to `null`, `Client` instances will not be removed or closed "
"based on age."
msgstr ""

